如“重构此模块并更新测试”）会被拆解并由专门的子智能体处理。\n- 人在回路：通过透明的工具调用审批系统，您始终拥有最终控制权。","tags":["人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/AIDotNet","releaseDate":"2026-03-12","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/AIDotNet/OpenCowork/releases/tag/0.5.6","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/a/AIDotNet/OpenCowork/0.5.6/AIDotNet.OpenCowork.yaml","sha256":"89913d389368f56e32313b18430065cd9457127fc2047a025d582faf3e3ee4d4"},{"path":"manifests/a/AIDotNet/OpenCowork/0.5.6/AIDotNet.OpenCowork.installer.yaml","sha256":"21ebffd25c1a9eb163788c94d429ea870cc330f7d5db59e8b5c22fbba073f893"},{"path":"manifests/a/AIDotNet/OpenCowork/0.5.6/AIDotNet.OpenCowork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"2d5e10defd5a89822fae385c79b0b42a57331067aeb095bed53e2865fe28e39c"},{"path":"manifests/a/AIDotNet/OpenCowork/0.5.6/AIDotNet.OpenCowork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"e05bd008293bf1ae78e274121bbd092ae2668b22352c37b786ba6b97bf27e660"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.5.6"}